# Bulk bytes stay local-only; indexes and receipts may be committed.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!manifest/
!manifest/*.json
!manifest/*.md
!relocation-receipts/
!relocation-receipts/*.json
!batch0-seal/
!batch0-seal/*.json
!batch0-seal/*.txt
!batch0-seal/*.md
!batch0-seal/remote-git-state/
!batch0-seal/remote-git-state/*.txt
!hidden-assets/**
